## D. Atrium
- [x] **16. Open-sky courtyard** x=17..21, z=12..17, no roof and no slab (dirt at y=0): glass_pane ring (x=16, x=22, z=11, z=18, y=2..4), dark_oak_log posts at the 4 corners and on x=19 at z=11, z=18 (y=4 only above the doors), dark_oak_planks header y=5, ring crossing band C glazed at y=6. Part 1 (header, openings), part 4 (glass, posts). Vocab `atrium_ring`.
